' FactStamp - Project Gantt Chart
' Chapter 3.3 - Planning and Scheduling
' Build:  plantuml -tsvg gantt_chart.puml
'
' Eight 2-week Scrum sprints, single developer, strictly sequential.
' Sprints 1-7 are complete; Sprint 8 is underway.
'
' COLOUR POLICY - deliberate, Gantt-only exception to the project-wide
' "skinparam monochrome true" rule (see Rules/Diagram-rules.md, Rule 6).
' Colour here encodes information, not decoration:
'
'   * One colour family per delivery phase, so the four phases group visually.
'   * The four families sit on a deliberate LIGHTNESS LADDER (approximate
'     greyscale luminance in brackets) so the phases stay tellable apart when
'     the black book is printed in black and white:
'         Phase 1  Foundation             pale green   #C9E4C5  [~217]
'         Phase 2  Detection Core         amber        #E0AE45  [~177]
'         Phase 3  Consensus and Delivery mid blue     #4E93BE  [~131]
'         Phase 4  Security and Release   indigo       #5B4B85  [~ 86]
'         Handover milestone              deep crimson #8E1B12  [~ 60]
'     Roughly 40 luminance steps between neighbours - hue alone is never load
'     bearing.
'   * Completed sprints (S1-S7) render as a fully saturated bar; the in-flight
'     S8 renders 40% filled against white, so "done" vs "in progress" reads
'     from the fill fraction, which survives greyscale untouched.

@startgantt

skinparam defaultFontName "Liberation Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam defaultFontStyle bold
skinparam titleFontSize 24
skinparam titleFontStyle bold
skinparam taskBorderThickness 2

title FactStamp - Project Gantt Chart (8 Sprints x 2 Weeks = 16 Weeks)

printscale weekly
Project starts 2026-06-01

-- Phase 1: Foundation --

[S1: Scaffolding + Auth] lasts 14 days
[S1: Scaffolding + Auth] is 100% complete
[S1: Scaffolding + Auth] is colored in #C9E4C5/#3F6B39

[S2: Ingestion + OCR] lasts 14 days
[S2: Ingestion + OCR] starts at [S1: Scaffolding + Auth]'s end
[S2: Ingestion + OCR] is 100% complete
[S2: Ingestion + OCR] is colored in #C9E4C5/#3F6B39

-- Phase 2: Detection Core --

[S3: Duplicate Detection] lasts 14 days
[S3: Duplicate Detection] starts at [S2: Ingestion + OCR]'s end
[S3: Duplicate Detection] is 100% complete
[S3: Duplicate Detection] is colored in #E0AE45/#7A560C

[S4: Verification Queue] lasts 14 days
[S4: Verification Queue] starts at [S3: Duplicate Detection]'s end
[S4: Verification Queue] is 100% complete
[S4: Verification Queue] is colored in #E0AE45/#7A560C

-- Phase 3: Consensus and Delivery --

[S5: Consensus Engine] lasts 14 days
[S5: Consensus Engine] starts at [S4: Verification Queue]'s end
[S5: Consensus Engine] is 100% complete
[S5: Consensus Engine] is colored in #4E93BE/#1B4762

[S6: Cards + Analytics] lasts 14 days
[S6: Cards + Analytics] starts at [S5: Consensus Engine]'s end
[S6: Cards + Analytics] is 100% complete
[S6: Cards + Analytics] is colored in #4E93BE/#1B4762

-- Phase 4: Security and Release --

[S7: Security + Admin] lasts 14 days
[S7: Security + Admin] starts at [S6: Cards + Analytics]'s end
[S7: Security + Admin] is 100% complete
[S7: Security + Admin] is colored in #5B4B85/#2C2444

' S8 is the only sprint still in flight: same Phase 4 indigo, but only 40% of
' the bar is filled, leaving the remainder white.
[S8: Hardening + Deploy] lasts 14 days
[S8: Hardening + Deploy] starts at [S7: Security + Admin]'s end
[S8: Hardening + Deploy] is 40% complete
[S8: Hardening + Deploy] is colored in #5B4B85/#2C2444

[Project Handover] happens at [S8: Hardening + Deploy]'s end
[Project Handover] is colored in #8E1B12/#4A0D08

@endgantt
